<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hero.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hero.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.15"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><a href="/idaho-appraisal-areas/">Service areas</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span aria-current="page">Boise</span></nav><p class="kicker">Treasure Valley</p><h1>Boise Insurance Appraiser</h1><p class="lede">Boise packs a century of housing into one valley, from 1910s bungalows to new homes pressed against the foothills. Each era fails differently in a storm or a fire, and each needs its own estimate.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-y" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line-w" href="/schedule-a-consult/">Free claim review</a></div><dl class="facts"><div><dt>County</dt><dd>Ada County</dd></div><div><dt>Region</dt><dd>Treasure Valley</dd></div><div><dt>Inspections</dt><dd>On site</dd></div></dl></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose"><div class="localbox"><div><h2 class="lb-t">Local claim risks</h2><ul class="chips"><li>Foothills wildfire</li><li>Summer hail</li><li>Microbursts</li><li>Frozen pipes</li><li>Smoke infiltration</li></ul></div><div><h2 class="lb-t">Housing mix</h2><p>Historic bungalows, mid-century ranches, foothills custom homes, downtown condos</p></div></div>

<h2>Claims across Boise’s neighborhoods</h2>
<p>The North End and East End hold some of Idaho’s oldest homes: Craftsman bungalows, brick foursquares and Victorian houses along Harrison Boulevard and Warm Springs Avenue. Plaster walls, old-growth trim and steep roofs make repairs slow and expensive, and estimates built for modern drywall routinely come up short. Up on the Bench, post-war ranch homes and split-levels carry their own issues with aging roofs and original plumbing.</p>
<p>Southeast Boise, Barber Valley and Harris Ranch sit closer to open foothills. The 2008 fire on the southeast bench destroyed ten homes, and the 2016 Table Rock Fire burned the slopes directly above the city. Homes along the foothills face ember exposure every summer, and the whole valley deals with smoke when fires burn elsewhere in the West.</p>
<h2>What a Boise insurance appraiser sees most</h2>
<ul>
<li>Hail and microburst damage from summer thunderstorms rolling off the Owyhee and Boise mountains.</li>
<li>Frozen pipes in older homes with uninsulated crawlspaces during January inversions and cold snaps.</li>
<li>Smoke and soot claims after foothills or regional fires.</li>
<li>Condo water losses in downtown and Bown Crossing buildings where the master policy and the HO-6 overlap.</li>
<li>Historic-district requirements that raise repair costs beyond standard pricing.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Working in Boise</h2>
<p>We inspect throughout the city, including the North End, East End, Boise Heights, the Bench, Collister, West Boise, Southeast Boise, Barber Valley and Harris Ranch. We can meet you on site, coordinate with your contractor, or start with a document review if you’re still gathering paperwork.</p>

<h2>Services for Boise property owners</h2>
<p>Every Idaho Insurance Appraiser service is available in Boise and the surrounding area, including:</p>
<ul><li><a href="/property-claim-appraisal/appraisal-clause-appraiser/">Appraisal Clause Representation</a></li><li><a href="/property-claim-appraisal/home-insurance-appraisal/">Homeowner Claim Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/property-claim-appraisal/commercial-hoa-farm-appraisal/">Commercial, HOA &amp; Farm Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/property-claim-appraisal/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/">Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/property-claim-appraisal/wind-microburst-claim-appraisal/">Wind &amp; Microburst Claim Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/property-claim-appraisal/water-frozen-pipe-appraisal/">Water &amp; Frozen Pipe Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/property-claim-appraisal/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/">Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/property-claim-appraisal/wildfire-claim-appraisal/">Wildfire Claim Appraisal</a></li></ul>
<h2>Questions for a Boise Insurance Appraiser</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do Boise historic district rules affect my claim?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>They can. Properties in Boise’s historic districts may need approved materials or methods, which can raise repair costs. Whether the policy pays for that depends on its ordinance-or-law coverage.</p></div></details><details><summary>My foothills home had smoke damage but no flames. Can you help?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Smoke-only claims are often disputed. We document residue and review testing, and if coverage is accepted, we can value the cleaning or replacement the home needs.</p></div></details></div>
